Advanced study of joints, retained load and maintenance (@mech-joints-study: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @mechanical-engineering, #source "../sources/Fastener-Design-Manual-NASA.lingua#r_78PXGW34SMJ44D965DX01WGZH5", #source "../sources/Elements-of-Mechanical-Design-MIT-2-72.lingua#r_31S9Z88TMF2875BF5KA5825GX7", #source "../sources/Bearing-Maintenance-Handbook-SKF.lingua#r_2KXP88XVRZAFSYK92QAM6QYYRV", #mechanical-engineering "Defend-machine-elements-as-an-interacting-assembly.lingua#r_6R4CPQRB4ACH3KPZZZH5N3TFTN") { r_3BFV1HYS3SGQ3NFS6XDM87XY92
**Read:** [Fastener Design Manual — NASA-RP-1228](../sources/Fastener-Design-Manual-NASA.lingua#r_78PXGW34SMJ44D965DX01WGZH5); [Elements of Mechanical Design — MIT 2.72, Spring 2009](../sources/Elements-of-Mechanical-Design-MIT-2-72.lingua#r_31S9Z88TMF2875BF5KA5825GX7), bolted joints and alignment interfaces; [Bearing maintenance handbook — SKF, 2011](../sources/Bearing-Maintenance-Handbook-SKF.lingua#r_2KXP88XVRZAFSYK92QAM6QYYRV), mounting, seals, alignment, lubrication, inspection, dismounting and damage. Inspect the applicable current component instructions alongside these historical mechanics sources.

Choose an assembly containing at least one loaded joint and one moving contact. Compare alternative connection and access arrangements. State how manufacture, preparation, assembly and service establish the material/contact condition on which the calculations depend.

**Derive:** Quantify load sharing, contact or preload, local stiffness, thermal mismatch and one plausible degradation mechanism. Propagate assembly uncertainty into a functional result. Compare the model before and after a declared contact change, such as separation, slip or lost clearance; do not continue the original equations through an invalid regime.

**Investigate:** Use measured or documented evidence to distinguish assembly error, overload, wear, contamination and material damage. Preserve the condition and chronology of the evidence before dismantling changes it. Propose a repair or maintenance intervention and a test that can establish restored function. Explain how accessible measurement and replacement affect the original design, including what is still unknown.

**Return:** [Mechanical engineering and machine design](../Mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design.lingua#r_0017YZ63HZBZ4P4WD8DECVWE4R).
**Continue:** [Defend machine elements as an interacting assembly](Defend-machine-elements-as-an-interacting-assembly.lingua#r_6R4CPQRB4ACH3KPZZZH5N3TFTN).

